      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "As your mastery over Equivalent Exchange grows, standard wooden chests—and even GregTech steel crates—begin to feel inadequate for holding the sheer density of your magical artifacts. By weaving spatial expansion runes and dense alchemical arrays into a reinforced container, you have forged the Alchemical Chest. This is no ordinary box; its interior space is warped, existing as a localized pocket dimension humming with magical resonance.\n\nFunctionally, this chest provides a massive 104 slots of storage space. However, its true power lies in its magical resonance: specific alchemical trinkets, rings, and amulets (like the Gem of Eternal Density or the Repair Talisman) will actively function while sitting inside the chest. Throw in some damaged tools and a Repair Talisman, and watch them fix themselves! Perhaps, with a little ingenuity, you can find even more automated uses for this unique mechanic?",
